OL,3,GNEWSAOfford pledges to scrap tax system
OL,4,Aand boost jobs under Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's leader in Scotland will
OL,7,Fpromise to scrap the six-band income
OL,8,Ftax system, boost jobs and address
OL,9,Fimmigration in his speech to the
OL,10,Fparty's conference later.
OL,12,FMalcolm Offord is set to address
OL,13,Fmembers on the final day of the
OL,14,Fgathering in Birmingham.
OL,16,FAhead of his speech, the West Scotland
OL,17,FMSP said his party showed that "real
OL,18,Fworld experience can top tired tropes
OL,19,Ffrom out-of-touch career politicians".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
